<h1 class="pb">Part 5 · The data pipeline, end to end</h1>

<h3>5.1 The diagram</h3>
<p>This is the whole app in one picture. Every 2 seconds (or every time a real band sends a packet),
one reading enters at the top and comes out the bottom as a number, a colour, and a sentence.</p>

<div class="diag">  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
