<tr><th style="width:34%">Getter</th><th>Used by</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>currentHealth</code>, <code>currentEnvironment</code>, <code>currentMotion</code>, <code>currentSleep</code>, <code>currentDevice</code></td><td>Every metric card and the Device screen</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>currentRisk</code></td><td>The Home gauge, driver bars, Insights breakdown</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>hrHistory</code>, <code>spo2History</code>, <code>tempHistory</code></td><td>The line charts on Vitals</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>lastPrediction</code>, <code>lastFeatureVector</code></td><td><b>Demo Lab — your verification window</b></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>alerts</code>, <code>activeScenario</code>, <code>isMockMode</code>, <code>userProfile</code></td><td>Insights feed, scenario chip, Demo Lab, Me</td></tr>
</table>

