<h1 class="pb">Part 6 · The data contracts (models)</h1>

<p>Everything in <code>lib/shared/models/</code>. These are the shapes your hardware must produce.
Each has a <code>fromJson</code> constructor — <b>the exact key names below are what your firmware
must send.</b> Get a key name wrong and that field silently falls back to its default.</p>

